WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.060 --> 01:38.900
=Episode 6=

01:56.500 --> 01:57.020
What?

01:57.260 --> 01:58.580
Does my chair bite?

01:59.100 --> 01:59.980
Why are you just standing there?

02:01.180 --> 02:01.460
Your...

02:02.100 --> 02:02.820
Your Highness.

02:08.260 --> 02:11.140
How's that immortality elixir

02:11.900 --> 02:12.420
I asked you to make?

02:14.140 --> 02:14.580
Your Highness,

02:15.060 --> 02:15.340
I...

02:16.340 --> 02:17.340
I can't make an elixir of immortality.

02:23.380 --> 02:24.380
You can't?

02:27.940 --> 02:28.700
So...

02:29.660 --> 02:31.820
you don't want to be my consort?

02:45.220 --> 02:46.700
All right, I'm just teasing you.

02:47.220 --> 02:48.100
I have nothing else planned tonight.

02:48.340 --> 02:49.260
I want to play backgammon with you.

03:00.660 --> 03:02.180
What do you think

03:02.780 --> 03:03.500
of that Yan Shang

03:04.460 --> 03:05.300
you were with today?

03:06.500 --> 03:06.980
Yan Shang?

03:08.380 --> 03:08.980
He's a good man.

03:10.020 --> 03:10.740
He's kind, too.

03:11.580 --> 03:12.380
He's always so nice to everyone.

03:13.380 --> 03:15.780
Lucky you never ran into bad people,

03:16.500 --> 03:18.420
or there'd be nothing left of you.

03:28.620 --> 03:29.700
What's got you so torn?

03:33.460 --> 03:33.940
Your Highness,

03:35.500 --> 03:36.100
today,

03:36.940 --> 03:38.340
besides Yan Shang and me,

03:39.220 --> 03:40.140
there was another friend.

03:46.660 --> 03:47.340
And?

03:49.820 --> 03:50.380
His name is...

03:51.220 --> 03:52.020
Feng Xianyu.

03:52.540 --> 03:53.380
He's very talented.

03:53.980 --> 03:54.740
- He said...
- So...

03:55.100 --> 03:56.460
this Mr. Feng

03:57.460 --> 03:58.700
sent you to me

03:59.660 --> 04:00.460
to recommend him?

04:04.860 --> 04:06.140
Look at you, Wei Shu.

04:07.020 --> 04:08.300
Li Zhi says you're clever,

04:09.100 --> 04:11.660
but you're a real fool, aren't you?

04:13.580 --> 04:16.020
Whenever you do something
against your conscience,

04:16.140 --> 04:17.460
you can barely get the words out.

04:18.460 --> 04:20.260
So why did you agree to it?

04:21.060 --> 04:21.580
Your Highness...

04:22.380 --> 04:23.340
Don't you realize

04:23.700 --> 04:24.860
you're both taking the imperial exams?

04:25.180 --> 04:26.380
You'll be competing against each other.

04:27.460 --> 04:27.860
Yes.

04:28.540 --> 04:30.860
You recommended him to me today.

04:31.460 --> 04:32.260
What about you?

04:33.620 --> 04:35.820
What if I took a fancy to him

04:36.260 --> 04:36.900
and

04:37.420 --> 04:38.220
recommended him

04:38.580 --> 04:39.420
instead of you?

04:40.060 --> 04:41.060
What would you do then?

04:45.780 --> 04:46.220
Your Highness,

04:47.100 --> 04:47.580
I'm sorry.

04:48.980 --> 04:49.580
You're right.

04:50.580 --> 04:51.460
If I can't bring myself

04:51.900 --> 04:52.700
to go against my conscience,

04:53.220 --> 04:54.180
I shouldn't have agreed.

04:54.500 --> 04:55.660
My mentor gave me an order,

04:56.500 --> 04:57.340
but I simply can't carry it out.

05:01.460 --> 05:02.140
I'm returning

05:03.140 --> 05:03.900
this cloak to you.

05:05.020 --> 05:06.340
Tomorrow, I'll ask the Director

05:06.780 --> 05:07.700
to expel me.

05:11.580 --> 05:12.900
Aren't you afraid

05:14.220 --> 05:15.220
Li Zhi will punish you?

05:18.660 --> 05:19.940
I'll apologize to my mentor.

05:21.100 --> 05:22.140
Your Highness, punish me as well.

05:24.420 --> 05:24.980
Wei Shu,

05:25.580 --> 05:26.660
you're quite adorable.

05:28.980 --> 05:29.740
Sit down. Relax.

05:30.540 --> 05:31.620
I have real business
to discuss with you.

05:34.060 --> 05:34.540
Your Highness...

05:34.860 --> 05:35.340
Sit.

05:37.820 --> 05:38.180
Yes.

05:46.660 --> 05:47.100
Wei Shu,

05:48.020 --> 05:48.660
listen carefully.

05:49.300 --> 05:50.700
Your mentor is my uncle.

05:51.700 --> 05:53.940
You know family orders carry
equal weight.

05:54.740 --> 05:55.460
I'm just as trapped

05:55.780 --> 05:56.700
by his plans as you are.

05:57.180 --> 05:57.580
But I...

05:57.620 --> 05:58.900
Let me finish.

05:59.940 --> 06:00.420
Today,

06:01.100 --> 06:02.620
I'd like us to make a pact.

06:03.500 --> 06:04.340
We'll work together.

06:04.980 --> 06:06.660
Until your imperial exams,

06:07.220 --> 06:08.380
we'll play along

06:08.820 --> 06:09.900
to keep your mentor happy.

06:10.940 --> 06:12.780
Just focus on your studies.

06:13.820 --> 06:14.780
And don't worry

06:15.020 --> 06:16.580
about the Wei family giving you trouble.

06:17.380 --> 06:18.140
From now on,

06:18.820 --> 06:21.180
I'll protect you.

06:23.140 --> 06:24.020
You like making elixirs, don't you?

06:25.940 --> 06:27.300
Then I'll set aside

06:27.500 --> 06:28.500
a spare room for you here.

06:29.300 --> 06:31.580
I'll get you everything you need
for that.

06:32.180 --> 06:34.060
You can do as you please.

06:35.340 --> 06:35.780
Really?

06:37.140 --> 06:38.260
Don't get too excited just yet.

06:39.700 --> 06:41.380
If you really want to thank me,

06:41.980 --> 06:44.060
make me a few more elixirs.

06:45.300 --> 06:45.820
Your Highness...

06:46.580 --> 06:47.460
There's no rush.

06:47.780 --> 06:48.580
Take your time.

06:49.780 --> 06:50.900
Once you've made them,

06:51.220 --> 06:53.260
I'll let you leave the residence.

06:58.660 --> 06:59.140
Your Highness,

07:00.540 --> 07:01.700
why are you helping me?

07:03.700 --> 07:04.740
Because I admire you.

07:06.660 --> 07:07.540
I admire you

07:08.100 --> 07:09.100
for who you are.

07:10.220 --> 07:11.140
Not for your family,

07:11.740 --> 07:12.580
not for my uncle,

07:13.300 --> 07:15.380
and certainly not because
you're someone's pawn.

07:23.820 --> 07:25.300
Why are you bowing again?

07:26.380 --> 07:26.820
Your Highness,

07:28.100 --> 07:29.940
I misjudged you before.

07:30.740 --> 07:31.540
I owe you an apology.

07:33.540 --> 07:35.420
Don't be so quick to apologize.

07:35.980 --> 07:36.780
What if

07:37.180 --> 07:38.260
you were right?

07:51.020 --> 07:51.940
How's my embroidery?

07:54.860 --> 07:56.500
Your embroidery

07:57.140 --> 07:57.980
still needs work.

08:02.580 --> 08:03.820
You should get some rest, Your Highness.

08:07.620 --> 08:08.100
Listen.

08:10.540 --> 08:11.660
The wind's picked up tonight.

08:13.460 --> 08:15.100
The roses outside are just blooming.

08:15.900 --> 08:17.140
How many will be blown away?

08:19.140 --> 08:19.860
I can't sleep.

08:20.580 --> 08:21.620
Warm me a pot of wine.

08:25.260 --> 08:27.620
You slept like a log in Lingnan.

08:28.180 --> 08:29.940
Why are you back to your old ways?

08:30.580 --> 08:31.740
Now that you mention it,

08:32.500 --> 08:33.380
you're right.

08:35.580 --> 08:36.980
Those days in Lingnan,

08:37.700 --> 08:40.180
Yan Shang kept me company every night,

08:41.460 --> 08:43.460
telling me all kinds of wild tales.

08:43.740 --> 08:45.900
Yan Shang's in Sheng'an now, anyway.

08:46.420 --> 08:47.460
Why not summon him

08:47.580 --> 08:48.940
to keep you company at bedtime?

08:49.380 --> 08:50.300
Why would I summon him?

08:51.140 --> 08:52.180
Why not call Wei Shu instead?

08:54.060 --> 08:55.500
I'll go fetch Mr. Wei, then.

08:55.740 --> 08:56.340
Come back!

08:57.580 --> 08:58.660
He's such a blockhead.

08:59.220 --> 08:59.980
If you call him over,

09:00.300 --> 09:01.700
he'll just blink at me

09:02.300 --> 09:03.380
and barely say a word.

09:03.660 --> 09:05.380
So Yan Shang's the better choice.

09:08.500 --> 09:09.140
I'm going to bed.

09:09.660 --> 09:10.300
You should get some sleep, too.

09:10.980 --> 09:11.940
Stop nagging me.

09:22.500 --> 09:23.460
Keep this up,

09:23.980 --> 09:25.260
and you'll wear yourself out.

09:43.140 --> 09:47.140
♪The midsummer breeze
blows soft and sweet♪

09:47.140 --> 09:51.540
♪Fireflies dance freely
through the night♪

09:51.740 --> 09:55.800
♪Chasing the beauty
of this fleeting world♪

09:55.800 --> 09:59.900
♪A thousand lights turn night into day♪

10:00.100 --> 10:04.020
♪Cicada songs mingle with the wine♪

10:04.020 --> 10:08.420
♪Their songs linger
through the passing years♪

10:08.700 --> 10:12.710
♪Life is but a fleeting stay♪

10:12.710 --> 10:16.500
♪How lucky I am
to walk this path with you♪

10:17.340 --> 10:21.610
♪Playing out life's game,
forever by your side♪

10:21.610 --> 10:25.500
♪Innocent years drift gently by♪

10:25.900 --> 10:29.980
♪I wish time could stand still♪

10:29.980 --> 10:33.860
♪Forever at that crossroads♪

10:34.380 --> 10:37.970
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade♪

10:37.970 --> 10:42.180
♪Weathering life's rise and fall♪

10:42.820 --> 10:46.570
♪Where endless time comes to an end♪

10:46.570 --> 10:50.940
♪Moonlight and breeze
fill our boat home♪

10:51.660 --> 10:54.890
♪Golden winds and jade dew return♪
(At dusk...)

10:54.890 --> 11:00.020
♪The world still blooms as before♪
(At dusk...)

11:00.140 --> 11:03.400
♪How lucky to roam with you♪
(At dusk, a small boat rocks)

11:03.400 --> 11:08.340
♪Back to the road where it all began♪
(At dusk, a small boat rocks)

11:08.540 --> 11:12.700
♪As if our youthful hearts remain♪

11:12.860 --> 11:14.540
♪As if our love will never fade♪
(At dusk, a small boat rocks)

11:14.540 --> 11:15.220
(Your name)

11:16.700 --> 11:17.580
(doesn't just mean)

11:18.860 --> 11:19.940
("a dusk-bound journey)

11:21.220 --> 11:22.580
(through wind and rain.")

11:33.540 --> 11:35.260
(Lodge of Wisdom)

11:36.500 --> 11:36.940
Wenji,

11:37.580 --> 11:38.940
I'm going to the West Market for ink.

11:39.460 --> 11:40.780
Are you running low on ink sticks, too?

11:40.980 --> 11:44.300
(Bamboo Dew)

11:44.300 --> 11:44.620
Wenji?

11:46.340 --> 11:46.620
Wenji?

11:48.660 --> 11:49.340
W-What's wrong?

11:50.180 --> 11:50.460
You...

11:51.140 --> 11:52.180
Is something bothering you?

11:52.900 --> 11:53.540
Ever since we settled here,

11:54.100 --> 11:55.340
you've seemed distracted.

11:56.260 --> 11:57.180
N-No, nothing.

11:57.700 --> 11:58.020
I...

11:58.980 --> 11:59.900
(Lodge of Wisdom)
The imperial exams are near.

12:00.460 --> 12:02.300
Nothing matters but studying.

12:13.140 --> 12:13.460
(No, this won't do.)

12:14.380 --> 12:15.500
(I still have to see her.)

12:16.220 --> 12:16.620
(Otherwise,)

12:17.260 --> 12:18.380
(how can I study in peace?)

12:32.460 --> 12:32.740
Yan Shang.

12:34.060 --> 12:34.500
Tell me,

12:34.940 --> 12:36.660
which outfit suits me better?

12:37.700 --> 12:38.460
What about this yellow one?

12:40.140 --> 12:40.500
This one.

12:42.100 --> 12:42.420
Which one?

12:44.260 --> 12:44.740
This one, I guess.

12:45.660 --> 12:45.980
This one?

12:47.500 --> 12:50.700
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

13:01.660 --> 13:02.700
(Liu Wenji...)

13:03.500 --> 13:04.460
(What are you doing?)

13:06.340 --> 13:08.220
(Princess Danyang's Residence)
(She's the princess's personal maid.)

13:09.100 --> 13:09.660
(Today,)

13:10.140 --> 13:11.300
(she might not even go out.)

13:15.940 --> 13:16.580
Liu Wenji!

13:19.260 --> 13:20.220
You've come to Sheng'an, too!

13:36.020 --> 13:37.060
Why so quiet?

13:40.980 --> 13:41.500
Seeing you...

13:42.460 --> 13:43.220
makes me so happy.

13:46.620 --> 13:47.180
Were you

13:47.820 --> 13:49.860
just passing by here?

13:52.420 --> 13:53.220
Yes, just passing by.

13:53.820 --> 13:54.540
I just happened to...

13:55.020 --> 13:55.700
run into you.

13:58.740 --> 13:59.780
Sheng'an is such a big place,

14:00.340 --> 14:01.060
with so many people.

14:02.380 --> 14:03.340
To run into you again,

14:03.580 --> 14:04.460
it must be fate!

14:09.300 --> 14:10.100
Where are you headed?

14:11.620 --> 14:12.300
Back to my lodgings.

14:12.740 --> 14:13.300
Where are you staying?

14:13.460 --> 14:14.380
I'll visit sometime.

14:14.940 --> 14:16.260
I've been staying with Yan Shang

14:16.260 --> 14:17.500
in a meditation room at Yongshou Temple.

14:17.860 --> 14:20.140
You're staying with Yan Shang
at Yongshou Temple?

14:22.820 --> 14:24.020
Come on. I'll go there with you.

14:25.820 --> 14:26.460
That won't do!

14:27.140 --> 14:27.940
Why not?

14:31.380 --> 14:31.820
Well...

14:33.380 --> 14:33.900
We...

14:34.340 --> 14:35.860
don't have our parents' approval

14:37.380 --> 14:38.140
or a matchmaker's blessing yet.

14:38.700 --> 14:39.580
How could we...

14:41.100 --> 14:42.860
Liu Wenji, what are you thinking?

14:44.980 --> 14:46.460
I'm going to see Yan Shang.

14:46.860 --> 14:47.900
I need to ask him a favor.

14:49.820 --> 14:50.820
Y-Yan Shang?

15:01.180 --> 15:01.500
Well...

15:02.420 --> 15:02.980
Then let's go.

15:03.260 --> 15:03.540
Let's go!

15:06.780 --> 15:07.540
Oh, I almost forgot my horse.

15:21.180 --> 15:22.660
Your Royal Highness, the tea is ready.

15:45.500 --> 15:45.940
Your Royal Highness.

15:47.660 --> 15:48.940
(Yang Si, third son of noble Yangs)
I've come all this way.

15:49.140 --> 15:50.340
Can't I catch my breath?

15:51.180 --> 15:52.020
We've barely traded a few moves,

15:52.500 --> 15:53.300
and you already need a rest?

15:55.500 --> 15:58.020
(Chongli Hall)

16:02.860 --> 16:05.100
(Lingbai Pavilion)

16:05.100 --> 16:07.780
(Chongli Hall)

16:11.900 --> 16:13.060
This tea was prepared
for His Royal Highness.

16:13.820 --> 16:14.140
No matter.

16:14.780 --> 16:16.180
Pour him another cup.

16:18.740 --> 16:19.260
Thank you.

16:31.300 --> 16:31.660
Well?

16:33.180 --> 16:34.500
Your tea is still the best.

16:35.060 --> 16:35.620
Mr. Yang,

16:36.380 --> 16:37.860
that's a Yue ware cup
reserved for His Royal Highness.

16:38.220 --> 16:39.180
(Lingbai Pavilion)
The tea's Mengding tea.

16:39.660 --> 16:40.740
And you gulp it down like a horse!

16:40.860 --> 16:42.620
How'd you know I learned it from horses?

16:43.460 --> 16:45.140
It's a quick way to kill your thirst.

16:45.900 --> 16:47.140
Your Royal Highness, you have no idea.

16:47.340 --> 16:48.420
I've been on the road for days.

16:48.860 --> 16:50.420
You've had a rough journey.

16:52.820 --> 16:54.780
Your Royal Highness,
why did you summon me back

16:55.380 --> 16:55.780
in such a hurry?

16:56.900 --> 16:57.300
Come in.

16:58.020 --> 16:58.660
Mind the step.

17:05.820 --> 17:06.700
We haven't tidied up in days,

17:07.260 --> 17:07.900
so it's a bit of a mess.

17:13.140 --> 17:13.780
Where's Yan Shang?

17:15.180 --> 17:16.340
The Imperial Academy
let out early today.

17:16.780 --> 17:17.620
He was still there when I left.

17:17.900 --> 17:19.260
He may have gone out by now.

17:24.820 --> 17:25.420
Have a seat.

17:25.660 --> 17:26.820
I-I'll get you some tea.

17:38.380 --> 17:40.140
(Confucius said...)

18:08.220 --> 18:09.500
Wasn't that tea for me?

18:13.460 --> 18:13.860
The tea...

18:17.740 --> 18:18.060
Here.

18:28.140 --> 18:28.900
Careful, it's hot.

18:39.700 --> 18:40.660
Funny how fate works.

18:41.060 --> 18:42.100
I hadn't left home in days,

18:42.500 --> 18:43.540
but the one time I went out today,

18:43.660 --> 18:44.660
I happened to run into you.

18:47.020 --> 18:47.780
I...

18:48.420 --> 18:49.540
I've been in Sheng'an for days.

18:51.660 --> 18:52.580
I've wanted to see you.

18:53.860 --> 18:54.580
It's just...

18:57.060 --> 18:57.620
Just what?

19:00.260 --> 19:01.500
The princess's residence
is heavily guarded,

19:01.700 --> 19:02.820
and I have no official title.

19:03.420 --> 19:04.580
Besides, you have to serve the princess.

19:06.540 --> 19:07.300
What's so difficult about that?

19:07.820 --> 19:09.260
I can come see you, too.

19:14.100 --> 19:15.380
You have so many books here.

19:19.580 --> 19:20.340
The exams are coming up.

19:21.140 --> 19:21.660
I should...

19:23.620 --> 19:24.900
I should focus on my studies.

19:29.980 --> 19:32.780
So you came to the capital
for the exams.

19:33.660 --> 19:36.740
Didn't you come top
in the prefectural exams?

19:38.180 --> 19:38.980
It was nothing.

19:40.740 --> 19:42.780
I'm not as impressive as you think.

19:43.500 --> 19:44.820
Sheng'an is full of talented scholars.

19:45.260 --> 19:46.300
My father always warned me

19:47.060 --> 19:48.620
not to grow proud or arrogant.

19:54.820 --> 19:55.780
Studying is hard enough.

19:56.100 --> 19:57.020
You came first.

19:57.300 --> 19:58.460
You deserve praise.

19:58.780 --> 19:59.700
You've earned it.

20:04.340 --> 20:04.740
Chunhua,

20:06.180 --> 20:07.340
you're the first person

20:08.540 --> 20:09.580
to ever tell me that.

20:12.820 --> 20:13.260
Thank you.

20:14.220 --> 20:14.660
You're welcome.

20:27.540 --> 20:27.980
Chunhua,

20:28.900 --> 20:29.460
why do you

20:30.420 --> 20:31.660
want to see Yan Shang?

20:34.780 --> 20:37.020
Actually, I'm not the one
who wants to see him.

20:37.460 --> 20:38.580
It's the princess.

20:40.180 --> 20:40.500
No, that's not right.

20:41.300 --> 20:43.620
I'm looking for Yan Shang
on the princess's behalf.

20:46.340 --> 20:47.060
When he gets back,

20:47.340 --> 20:48.420
could you tell him

20:48.580 --> 20:49.740
to come to the princess's residence?

20:49.820 --> 20:50.700
I need to ask him a favor.

20:51.940 --> 20:52.300
All right.

20:52.900 --> 20:53.220
I'll tell him.

20:54.260 --> 20:54.740
Thank you.

20:56.220 --> 20:57.460
I still have things to buy
for the princess,

20:57.580 --> 20:58.100
so I'd better go.

20:58.220 --> 20:58.940
I won't keep you from studying.

21:08.180 --> 21:08.860
Oh, Wenji...

21:09.260 --> 21:10.140
Why did you want to see me?

21:10.660 --> 21:10.940
I...

21:13.580 --> 21:14.460
Never mind. I'd better go.

21:14.620 --> 21:15.340
I'll visit when I have time.

21:24.420 --> 21:24.860
Chunhua!

21:25.300 --> 21:25.740
Chunhua!

21:29.060 --> 21:29.500
What's wrong?

21:30.260 --> 21:31.140
Did I leave anything behind?

21:34.020 --> 21:34.500
Chunhua,

21:35.580 --> 21:36.460
on the tenth of the third month,

21:37.060 --> 21:38.220
there'll be a peony festival
in Jinchang Ward.

21:38.820 --> 21:39.460
It's quite a spectacle.

21:40.300 --> 21:41.260
Let's go together.

21:45.500 --> 21:46.220
Is that an invitation?

21:48.620 --> 21:49.020
Yes.

21:50.780 --> 21:52.220
No one's ever invited me before.

21:52.660 --> 21:54.700
People used to invite the princess.

21:55.020 --> 21:55.260
I...

21:55.260 --> 21:55.860
I'm inviting you, and only you!

22:09.540 --> 22:10.020
I'd love to.

22:10.780 --> 22:11.500
I'll be there for sure.

22:35.740 --> 22:36.860
(To My Esteemed Father:)

22:38.540 --> 22:40.820
(I've been in the capital
for several days.)

22:41.860 --> 22:43.060
(I'll heed your teachings)

22:43.940 --> 22:45.220
(and never forget my duty)

22:46.100 --> 22:47.740
(to bring honor to our family.)

23:04.420 --> 23:08.700
(to bring honor to our family.)

23:17.700 --> 23:19.170
("To My Esteemed Father...)

23:19.170 --> 23:20.740
(... to bring honor to our family.")

23:34.580 --> 23:34.980
Wenji,

23:35.780 --> 23:36.780
I've bought new ink and brushes.

23:37.300 --> 23:37.620
Yan Shang.

23:39.420 --> 23:40.380
Leave those for now.

23:40.620 --> 23:41.740
Chunhua told me

23:41.900 --> 23:43.700
she wants you
at the princess's residence

23:44.100 --> 23:45.100
for a favor.

23:55.500 --> 23:56.060
What's this?

23:57.580 --> 23:58.380
A peace offering.

24:00.380 --> 24:02.980
(Qingfeng Pavilion)

24:27.460 --> 24:27.940
Yang Si!

24:29.260 --> 24:29.900
Get out here!

24:35.140 --> 24:35.460
Wanyao!

24:38.220 --> 24:39.020
What brings you back?

24:40.860 --> 24:41.700
Things have been quiet at the border,

24:42.300 --> 24:43.180
so I left the army and came home.

24:45.340 --> 24:46.140
It's been three years.

24:47.100 --> 24:48.140
I've just returned from North Jing, too.

24:54.020 --> 24:54.340
Here.

24:59.620 --> 25:00.420
After all this time,

25:01.020 --> 25:02.260
you greet me with a bag of fruit?

25:02.940 --> 25:04.260
These aren't ordinary fruits.

25:05.140 --> 25:05.660
They're

25:06.260 --> 25:07.060
tribute fruits.

25:09.060 --> 25:10.020
You got them from the Crown Prince?

25:14.060 --> 25:15.820
You know how hard life is in the army.

25:16.340 --> 25:17.980
My pay barely covers my wine.

25:18.500 --> 25:21.740
So I swiped some fruit to make do.

25:22.660 --> 25:22.940
No, I mean,

25:23.460 --> 25:24.100
as a gift for you.

25:25.420 --> 25:27.220
Some big name in Sheng'an you are!

25:27.780 --> 25:28.700
If you can't afford wine,

25:28.780 --> 25:29.740
go charm some people for money.

25:30.140 --> 25:31.540
Plenty of young ladies in Sheng'an

25:32.020 --> 25:33.500
would gladly buy you wine.

25:34.140 --> 25:34.540
Wanyao.

25:35.020 --> 25:35.980
What are you implying?

25:36.620 --> 25:37.340
Are you jealous?

25:43.380 --> 25:43.780
Tell me,

25:44.700 --> 25:45.620
why did the Crown Prince

25:46.100 --> 25:46.660
send you here?

25:55.260 --> 25:56.300
(Yan Shang, come on! Hurry!)

26:12.660 --> 26:13.060
Yan Shang.

26:43.020 --> 26:43.460
(Yan Shang!)

26:44.020 --> 26:44.420
(Come on!)

26:49.740 --> 26:50.100
Wanyao,

26:50.820 --> 26:52.060
you know I always speak my mind.

26:53.300 --> 26:53.780
Lately,

26:54.620 --> 26:56.780
Yu Cheng'an has been acting
like he owns the court.

26:58.020 --> 26:58.300
And...

26:59.100 --> 27:00.620
you bear that ominous prophecy.

27:01.740 --> 27:02.580
Have you ever thought

27:02.780 --> 27:03.740
that with one word from him,

27:04.700 --> 27:06.780
you could be sent back to North Jing,

27:07.700 --> 27:08.140
or

27:08.860 --> 27:10.020
married off to someone else?

27:10.260 --> 27:10.980
So?

27:13.900 --> 27:14.420
I'll

27:15.340 --> 27:16.100
make a sacrifice

27:17.340 --> 27:17.820
and marry you.

27:18.820 --> 27:19.180
What do you say?

27:19.620 --> 27:20.220
No way.

27:22.500 --> 27:23.420
Why would you marry me?

27:25.020 --> 27:25.780
Because you like me?

27:33.380 --> 27:34.620
Whether I like you or not...

27:34.620 --> 27:35.900
w-what does that matter?

27:36.300 --> 27:37.060
We grew up together.

27:37.060 --> 27:38.020
Why bring that up now?

27:38.820 --> 27:39.940
I can't just leave you
to fend for yourself.

27:40.100 --> 27:40.820
Then don't bring it up.

27:41.860 --> 27:43.180
Even if it's just a marriage
of convenience?

27:45.380 --> 27:46.140
Wanyao!

27:47.020 --> 27:47.460
One more thing.

27:48.620 --> 27:49.460
I'm all grown up now.

27:50.420 --> 27:51.420
Stop treating me like a child.

27:53.020 --> 27:54.460
Your Highness, look who's here!

28:06.380 --> 28:06.780
Your Highness.

28:07.460 --> 28:08.100
I've come at a bad time.

28:08.780 --> 28:09.580
You certainly have.

28:12.300 --> 28:13.020
Why are you here?

28:13.620 --> 28:14.500
To thank me for getting you

28:15.020 --> 28:16.100
into the Imperial Academy?

28:27.980 --> 28:29.740
Is this the guy
your uncle picked for you?

28:31.740 --> 28:32.420
What was his name again?

28:32.820 --> 28:33.300
Wei Shu?

28:33.740 --> 28:34.180
Shut up!

28:35.540 --> 28:36.140
Look at you.

28:37.860 --> 28:39.100
You're from a noble family,

28:41.060 --> 28:42.900
yet you're practically begging
to be a male favorite.

28:44.180 --> 28:45.980
You think a pretty face
lets you get away with anything?

28:46.540 --> 28:47.660
And you call yourself educated?

28:47.820 --> 28:48.340
Yang Si!

28:50.700 --> 28:52.060
Wanyao, you're shouting at me!

28:52.540 --> 28:54.020
Over some outsider, no less!

28:54.420 --> 28:55.820
Weren't you trying to provoke me, too?

28:57.260 --> 28:58.540
That's different!

28:59.340 --> 29:00.620
I'm worried he'll deceive you.

29:01.260 --> 29:02.220
And now you're taking his side!

29:02.460 --> 29:03.260
You're even defending him!

29:04.140 --> 29:05.580
Mu Wanyao, you've changed.

29:05.580 --> 29:06.660
You've forgotten all about loyalty!

29:06.820 --> 29:07.420
Get lost!

29:08.100 --> 29:09.540
How old are you?
Aren't you tired of this?

29:14.740 --> 29:15.140
And you?

29:17.300 --> 29:18.460
What exactly are you here for?

29:21.300 --> 29:22.540
Your Highness is right.

29:23.380 --> 29:24.380
I came to thank you.

29:25.020 --> 29:25.580
That's all?

29:26.860 --> 29:28.820
A measly "thank you"? What good is that?

29:34.100 --> 29:34.980
Is this your token of gratitude?

29:38.220 --> 29:38.660
Hand it over.

29:40.700 --> 29:42.380
A thank-you gift? Let me see!

29:46.900 --> 29:48.260
You're awfully protective of it.

29:49.660 --> 29:50.780
I'll bet that box holds

29:51.220 --> 29:53.340
some lousy calligraphy or painting.

29:53.740 --> 29:54.500
What's so precious about that?

29:55.700 --> 29:58.340
Is it a painting by Gu Daozhi
or calligraphy by Liu Yici?

29:58.340 --> 29:59.420
That's none of your business.

30:10.580 --> 30:11.020
Give it to me.

30:19.220 --> 30:19.940
There's been a misunderstanding.

30:20.780 --> 30:21.220
This painting

30:21.860 --> 30:22.780
was a gift from a friend.

30:23.780 --> 30:25.220
It's not my thank-you gift
to Your Highness.

30:25.540 --> 30:26.140
Yan Shang!

30:27.060 --> 30:27.660
You tricked me!

30:28.660 --> 30:29.100
Your Highness,

30:29.780 --> 30:30.820
I'm not from a noble family.

30:31.380 --> 30:33.020
My family has no wealth,
and I own little of value.

30:33.460 --> 30:34.340
I truly have nothing to repay you with.

30:35.500 --> 30:35.820
However,

30:36.420 --> 30:37.540
if there's anything you want,

30:37.900 --> 30:39.420
that I can afford or do,

30:40.260 --> 30:41.700
I'll gladly do it for you.

30:42.020 --> 30:42.460
No need.

30:43.260 --> 30:44.620
I want nothing from you.

30:45.020 --> 30:45.340
Get out!

30:50.540 --> 30:50.980
In that case,

30:52.060 --> 30:52.860
I'll take my leave.

31:01.940 --> 31:03.420
Isn't he from the noble Wei family?

31:04.100 --> 31:05.260
How come he said he's not nobility?

31:05.740 --> 31:06.540
Why do you care?

31:07.300 --> 31:07.820
You get out, too!

31:08.300 --> 31:09.540
Stop annoying me here!

31:10.140 --> 31:10.420
Get out!

31:18.820 --> 31:19.220
Wanyao.

31:20.180 --> 31:20.660
Well...

31:20.940 --> 31:22.980
I'll let this slide.

31:23.260 --> 31:24.180
I'll come see you another day.

31:31.060 --> 31:31.820
Yang Si,

31:32.660 --> 31:33.820
you're despicable.

31:34.940 --> 31:36.860
You know perfectly well
she's being used.

31:37.580 --> 31:38.060
(Yang Si,)

31:38.900 --> 31:40.020
(if Danyang could marry you,)

31:40.740 --> 31:41.780
(I'd feel at ease about her.)

31:42.620 --> 31:43.420
(You're all I have.)

32:10.340 --> 32:14.860
(At dusk, a small boat rocks)

32:38.820 --> 32:42.700
(Imperial Academy; Gathering Auspice)

32:42.820 --> 32:43.260
Greetings, Chancellor Liu.

32:43.500 --> 32:43.860
Greetings, Chancellor Liu.

32:46.220 --> 32:47.020
(Mr. Li! Over here!)

32:47.260 --> 32:47.580
(This way!)

32:47.820 --> 32:48.100
(Here!)

32:48.460 --> 32:48.820
(Catch!)

32:48.820 --> 32:49.140
(Over here!)

32:49.140 --> 32:49.860
(Pass it!)

32:50.620 --> 32:51.820
They're playing foot polo?

32:51.900 --> 32:52.820
(Pass it! Mr. Li!)

32:53.300 --> 32:54.620
Those little rascals!

32:55.060 --> 32:56.540
(Director of the Imperial Academy)
They still have energy after class.

32:56.900 --> 32:58.340
They've got energy to spare.

32:59.540 --> 33:00.780
Getting more exercise

33:01.020 --> 33:02.460
is a good thing.

33:04.300 --> 33:05.660
(Liu Huaiyan, Retired Chancellor)
You always see things clearly.

33:06.020 --> 33:06.980
In your opinion,

33:07.540 --> 33:09.780
are there any promising talents

33:10.380 --> 33:12.020
among this year's young scholars?

33:12.700 --> 33:13.700
I believe

33:14.180 --> 33:16.500
there are always promising talents.

33:17.340 --> 33:20.220
Whether the court can make use of them

33:20.660 --> 33:22.220
depends on their fortunes.

33:23.500 --> 33:25.860
Take Wei Shu, for example.

33:26.460 --> 33:27.660
Though born to a concubine,

33:28.020 --> 33:29.260
he has extraordinary talent.

33:29.980 --> 33:33.100
It's a shame
he's so aloof and withdrawn.

33:34.660 --> 33:36.780
Then there's Feng Xianyu.

33:37.260 --> 33:39.540
He's Wei Shu's complete opposite.

33:39.900 --> 33:41.140
He's too restless and impulsive,

33:41.540 --> 33:43.540
so his character bears watching.

33:46.180 --> 33:46.740
Chancellor Liu, look.

33:47.900 --> 33:49.780
The student watching the game over there

33:50.100 --> 33:50.860
is Yan Shang.

33:51.420 --> 33:53.460
He's well-read and very bright.

33:54.260 --> 33:55.180
Yet somehow,

33:55.180 --> 33:57.460
he doesn't seem interested
in his studies.

33:57.540 --> 33:57.980
(Yan Shang!)

33:58.260 --> 33:59.260
I wonder why.

34:01.260 --> 34:01.780
(Mr. Li!)

34:01.900 --> 34:02.340
(Yan Shang,)

34:02.900 --> 34:03.860
(feeling better after that rest?)

34:04.100 --> 34:04.820
(Ready for another round?)

34:05.460 --> 34:06.260
(Come on! Want to try again?)

34:06.260 --> 34:07.020
(Come on, Yan Shang! Try!)

34:07.260 --> 34:07.700
- (Let's play!)
- (Come on!)

34:07.700 --> 34:08.220
(Come join us!)

34:12.420 --> 34:14.180
Come on, let's play chess.

34:29.820 --> 34:36.060
(Imperial Academy)

34:36.060 --> 34:36.780
Wei Shu, where are you going?

34:37.180 --> 34:37.820
Why don't we go together?

34:39.020 --> 34:40.180
I'm going to
Princess Danyang's residence.

34:40.700 --> 34:42.060
Feng Xianyu, care to join me?

34:44.580 --> 34:44.940
Well...

34:45.940 --> 34:47.020
I won't keep you.

34:53.740 --> 35:00.730
(Virtuous and Learned)

35:02.420 --> 35:02.820
What's wrong?

35:03.900 --> 35:04.740
Where are you headed?

35:06.500 --> 35:07.420
To seek a recommendation.

35:07.580 --> 35:08.060
What about you?

35:09.500 --> 35:10.500
Same as you.

35:12.140 --> 35:13.540
(Virtuous and Learned)

35:13.540 --> 35:13.980
Yan Shang,

35:15.340 --> 35:16.780
seeking a recommendation

35:16.980 --> 35:18.220
is a long, hard road

35:19.020 --> 35:20.140
to success.

35:21.340 --> 35:23.380
(Imperial Academy)
As the saying goes, enduring hardship

35:23.500 --> 35:24.420
makes you rise above the rest.

35:25.180 --> 35:26.220
(Mingde)
Wouldn't you agree?

35:27.820 --> 35:28.220
Feng Xianyu,

35:29.020 --> 35:29.940
I've read your poems and essays.

35:30.660 --> 35:32.220
You're talented and hardworking.

35:32.860 --> 35:34.980
I'm sure you'll go far one day.

35:37.780 --> 35:38.820
I'll remember your kind words.

35:39.780 --> 35:40.620
You and Wei Shu

35:41.180 --> 35:42.220
(Gathering Auspice)
have Princess Danyang's favor.

35:43.940 --> 35:45.300
You don't have the worries we do.

35:47.180 --> 35:47.580
Yan Shang,

35:49.220 --> 35:49.660
(Yizhuo Gate)
I'll take my leave.

35:52.820 --> 35:57.100
(Gathering Auspice)

36:26.260 --> 36:27.420
I, Feng Xianyu,

36:27.860 --> 36:29.140
pay my respects to Your Highness!

36:32.900 --> 36:33.460
Rise.

36:35.620 --> 36:36.420
Thank you, Your Highness.

36:40.460 --> 36:41.260
Stand up.

36:44.420 --> 36:45.220
Let me have a look at you.

36:51.300 --> 36:52.060
Very good.

36:53.580 --> 36:54.940
You've come to the right person

36:55.860 --> 36:57.020
for a recommendation.

36:57.340 --> 37:00.220
I'd gladly play music, paint,

37:00.380 --> 37:01.300
and admire flowers

37:01.580 --> 37:03.100
with Your Highness.

37:03.180 --> 37:03.980
Come in.

37:06.660 --> 37:07.340
Feng Xianyu,

37:08.420 --> 37:09.780
take a good look.

37:11.180 --> 37:11.980
Tell me,

37:12.540 --> 37:14.540
which of them couldn't do what you can?

37:15.300 --> 37:16.460
Since you've come seeking my help,

37:16.900 --> 37:17.820
you may stay here, too.

37:18.340 --> 37:18.780
Your Highness!

37:19.820 --> 37:21.060
I have a wife and daughter.

37:21.460 --> 37:23.460
I can't be Your Highness's
male favorite.

37:23.780 --> 37:24.820
You don't want to stay?

37:25.420 --> 37:26.340
Then get out!

37:29.420 --> 37:31.580
One day, you'll understand.

37:34.860 --> 37:35.300
Get out!

38:00.100 --> 38:00.500
Captain!

38:01.260 --> 38:02.700
A student wishes to see you.

38:03.340 --> 38:04.460
What does a student want with me?

38:04.580 --> 38:05.300
I can't even read.

38:05.820 --> 38:06.140
Send him away.

38:06.940 --> 38:07.380
Captain!

38:07.860 --> 38:09.460
He's a student at the Imperial Academy.

38:09.820 --> 38:11.140
He's come seeking your recommendation.

38:11.500 --> 38:12.100
Want a recommendation?

38:12.820 --> 38:13.380
From me?

38:17.820 --> 38:19.780
Greetings, Captain. I'm Yan Shang.

38:21.980 --> 38:23.060
Your name is Yan Shang?

38:24.860 --> 38:25.220
Yes.

38:36.260 --> 38:38.660
Why do you look so familiar?

38:39.380 --> 38:40.500
I was fortunate enough

38:40.980 --> 38:42.700
to meet you at Cuiyun Tower
the other day.

39:20.980 --> 39:21.380
No, wait.

39:23.620 --> 39:24.380
It wasn't at Cuiyun Tower.

39:26.980 --> 39:28.860
I've definitely seen you before.

39:34.820 --> 39:36.580
You have a remarkable memory, Captain.

39:37.500 --> 39:39.060
At Caimei Ridge in Lingnan Circuit,

39:39.940 --> 39:41.420
I ran into you
outside the county office.

39:47.060 --> 39:48.100
(Santu County Office)

39:49.300 --> 39:51.300
(Santu County Office)

40:07.660 --> 40:08.220
Now I remember!

40:10.020 --> 40:10.500
That's where I've seen you!

40:12.700 --> 40:14.100
I've long admired you, Captain.

40:16.380 --> 40:17.060
What a coincidence.

40:17.940 --> 40:19.620
I ran into you again at Cuiyun Tower.

40:20.180 --> 40:21.300
Because of you,

40:21.860 --> 40:23.460
Xu Mianmian, that little hussy,

40:23.460 --> 40:25.140
got away from me!

40:26.500 --> 40:27.140
Please calm down, Captain.

40:27.780 --> 40:29.580
I got carried away that day

40:30.340 --> 40:31.700
and approached you without thinking.

40:32.660 --> 40:34.660
I didn't mean to spoil your fun.

40:38.220 --> 40:39.540
At least you've got good taste.

40:41.060 --> 40:42.340
I'll remember you from now on.

40:43.260 --> 40:44.540
You're seeking a recommendation, right?

40:45.260 --> 40:46.100
Let me see your work.

40:49.340 --> 40:50.180
Please give me your guidance.

40:58.140 --> 41:01.260
(Am I supposed to critique it, too?)

41:03.340 --> 41:05.140
(Content of the Essay)
(Where does it begin?)

41:05.500 --> 41:07.540
(Content of the Essay)
(Where does it end?)

41:16.940 --> 41:19.220
My knowledge is limited,
and my writing is poor.

41:19.540 --> 41:20.060
I'm afraid

41:20.860 --> 41:21.900
it won't meet your standards.

41:24.020 --> 41:25.180
It's not very good.

41:25.580 --> 41:26.340
And you expect me

41:26.700 --> 41:28.700
to recommend this to Lord Yu?

41:29.020 --> 41:30.220
I'd be a laughingstock!

41:31.460 --> 41:32.300
I'm deeply ashamed.

41:33.180 --> 41:34.780
Your critique alone is an honor.

41:35.980 --> 41:37.780
I wouldn't dare presume to meet Lord Yu.

41:38.860 --> 41:39.940
(Forget you, boy.)

41:40.860 --> 41:43.340
(Even I can barely get an audience
with Lord Yu.)

41:44.980 --> 41:45.900
A recommendation

41:46.820 --> 41:47.820
isn't out of the question.

41:49.580 --> 41:50.700
How much are you willing to pay?

41:54.020 --> 41:54.980
I'm ashamed to say it,

41:55.940 --> 41:57.660
but I'm short on money.

41:59.580 --> 41:59.900
However,

42:00.700 --> 42:02.140
if there's anything else you need,

42:02.740 --> 42:04.740
I'll gladly do my best to help!

42:09.420 --> 42:11.540
But now that you're in Sheng'an,

42:11.940 --> 42:13.540
you can get whatever you want.

42:14.460 --> 42:16.380
Even if I wanted to be of use,

42:16.940 --> 42:17.460
I'm afraid

42:18.220 --> 42:19.500
I'm not even fit to tie your boots.

42:22.060 --> 42:23.740
With those skinny arms and legs,

42:23.740 --> 42:24.860
what could you possibly do for me?

42:25.860 --> 42:27.980
Well, I do have a problem.

42:29.180 --> 42:29.820
Xu Mianmian

42:30.380 --> 42:31.260
at Cuiyun Tower

42:32.420 --> 42:33.380
doesn't know what's good for her.

42:34.540 --> 42:35.660
She refuses to serve me.

42:36.100 --> 42:38.060
Get her to give in,

42:38.180 --> 42:40.060
and I'll reward you handsomely.

42:43.660 --> 42:44.820
Captain, you're tough as iron.

42:45.460 --> 42:46.860
You may not understand women.

42:47.740 --> 42:49.700
Kindness works better than force.

42:50.420 --> 42:51.700
Give me a few days.

42:52.340 --> 42:54.460
I'll take care of it.

43:00.780 --> 43:02.060
You'd better.

43:03.860 --> 43:04.500
You scholars...

43:05.220 --> 43:05.780
You're always

43:06.380 --> 43:07.100
full of clever tricks.

43:08.700 --> 43:10.300
Pull this off,

43:11.660 --> 43:13.500
and I'll make you the top scholar!

43:18.180 --> 43:18.860
Leave it to me.

43:19.300 --> 43:20.100
Just wait for my word.

43:53.780 --> 43:56.620
(Zhang Renjing)

44:00.100 --> 44:02.740
(Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing)

44:22.380 --> 44:27.100
(Next Episode Preview)

44:27.700 --> 44:29.700
The Peony Goddess at Sigui Garden

44:29.980 --> 44:31.860
is said to grant prayers for children.

44:32.420 --> 44:34.020
The Peony Festival is tomorrow.

44:34.820 --> 44:35.900
Why not come with me?

44:36.460 --> 44:37.420
Thank you for the kind invitation.

44:37.580 --> 44:38.820
The festival will be crowded.

44:39.140 --> 44:39.860
I'm not used to crowds.

44:43.441 --> 44:46.734
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

44:49.419 --> 44:54.335
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

44:56.529 --> 45:02.374
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:02.874 --> 45:08.100
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

45:10.869 --> 45:15.660
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

45:16.496 --> 45:22.575
♪Through trails of mud and blood;
let grief drown in your eyes♪

45:24.376 --> 45:27.526
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

45:27.526 --> 45:29.174
♪Burning bright as a song♪

45:29.226 --> 45:32.950
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

45:33.328 --> 45:37.994
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

45:38.613 --> 45:42.654
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

45:43.145 --> 45:45.260
♪Not a single hour less♪

45:45.300 --> 45:52.246
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

45:53.009 --> 45:56.462
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

45:56.642 --> 45:59.787
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:00.226 --> 46:06.863
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

46:07.260 --> 46:11.774
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:11.812 --> 46:14.281
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:14.485 --> 46:21.372
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:21.684 --> 46:24.955
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

46:25.260 --> 46:28.433
♪My last untouched innocence♪

46:28.757 --> 46:32.183
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

46:32.416 --> 46:35.641
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

46:35.972 --> 46:42.768
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

46:43.137 --> 46:47.703
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:47.750 --> 46:50.088
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:50.319 --> 46:57.154
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

46:57.503 --> 46:59.121
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

46:59.251 --> 47:01.047
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:01.404 --> 47:04.421
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:04.461 --> 47:05.788
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
